<b>📺 Sonarr</b> · <font color="#3498db">✏️ Renamed</font>
<ul>
<li><b>Series:</b> {{ trigger.payload_json.series.title }}</li>
<li><b>Files renamed:</b> {{ trigger.payload_json.renamedEpisodeFiles | length }}</li>
